WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.783
Once upon a time, there was a big farm.

2
00:00:03.784 --> 00:00:09.675
On this farm lived a donkey, a lapdog, and their master.

3
00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:14.636
The farmer was very fond of his lapdog.

4
00:00:14.637 --> 00:00:17.438
The dog knew many tricks.

5
00:00:17.439 --> 00:00:23.982
He made the farmer laugh.

6
00:00:23.983 --> 00:00:27.760
The donkey worked very hard for his master.

7
00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:30.436
He wanted to please the farmer.

8
00:00:30.437 --> 00:00:33.616
But the farmer did not notice.

9
00:00:33.617 --> 00:00:39.209
"I wish I didn’t have to work so hard," said the donkey.

10
00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:44.951
"The dog does nothing but the farmer still loves him.

11
00:00:44.952 --> 00:00:49.347
I wish I could do nothing."

12
00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:53.793
Of course, the donkey had a warm stable to sleep in.

13
00:00:53.794 --> 00:00:57.838
He had lots of food to eat and water to drink.

14
00:00:57.839 --> 00:01:03.067
The farmer made sure the donkey was as comfortable as any other donkey.

15
00:01:03.068 --> 00:01:08.145
But the donkey was still jealous of the dog.

16
00:01:08.146 --> 00:01:12.555
The donkey wanted to live inside the house with the farmer.

17
00:01:12.556 --> 00:01:18.534
He wanted to sit around and do nothing, just like the dog.

18
00:01:18.535 --> 00:01:23.224
One day, the donkey decided to quit being a donkey.

19
00:01:23.225 --> 00:01:28.281
"I am going to be just like the dog," said the donkey.

20
00:01:28.282 --> 00:01:34.881
"Then the farmer will love me as much as he loves the dog."

21
00:01:34.882 --> 00:01:38.547
The donkey ran into his master’s house.

22
00:01:38.548 --> 00:01:41.964
He tried to remember what the dog did.

23
00:01:41.965 --> 00:01:45.900
The donkey tried to chase his tail like the dog.

24
00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:49.806
Then he jumped up and down like the dog.

25
00:01:49.807 --> 00:01:54.268
"Where is the farmer?" wondered the donkey.

26
00:01:54.269 --> 00:01:58.862
"No, no . . . no!" shouted the farmer.

27
00:01:58.863 --> 00:02:02.958
The donkey jumped up and landed on the farmer’s lap.

28
00:02:02.959 --> 00:02:07.417
Then he licked the farmer’s face, just like the dog.

29
00:02:07.418 --> 00:02:13.973
The donkey waited for the farmer to pet him on the head or give him a special treat.

30
00:02:13.974 --> 00:02:19.167
But instead of a treat, the donkey got a big surprise.

31
00:02:19.168 --> 00:02:21.386
"What a crazy donkey!"

32
00:02:21.387 --> 00:02:26.683
shouted the farmer, as he smacked the donkey on its head.

33
00:02:26.684 --> 00:02:32.201
From that day on, the farmer made the donkey work harder and harder.

34
00:02:32.202 --> 00:02:36.240
"I’m so miserable," cried the donkey.

35
00:02:36.241 --> 00:02:41.449
"Why did I ever want to be like the dog?" he wailed.

36
00:02:41.453 --> 00:02:52.243
It is better to be happy with what you have than to take something you are not fit to receive.

